{
 "encounter_id": "00675",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "FAMILY_MEMBER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Morning, doctor. Sorry, we're a few minutes early. Mia won't say it, so I will, it's the trains. She had another bad one on Monday. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks, Gareth. Mia, I'd like to hear it from you, whenever you're ready. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Well. It's... the commute. I get these panic attacks on the Northern line. Monday, no, Tuesday. Gareth says Monday."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take your time. What happens in one?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My heart races, it feels like it's going to burst out of my chest. And then I can't get my breath, and I have to get off."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How often does this happen?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About twice a week at the moment. It was every day in March."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you feel anything else, dizzy, sweaty?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dizzy, yes. The platform sort of tilts."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And how are you sleeping?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Badly. I wake up at three and just lie there thinking about the journey."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had any chest pain during these?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain. It's the racing that frightens me, not pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any thoughts of harming yourself?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She'd tell you, honestly. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, Gareth. Mia, any fainting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've never fainted. Never actually fallen."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sertraline, 100 mg, once a day. Propranolol, 40 mg, when I'm panicky, on the train mostly. And melatonin, 2 mg, at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any allergies to anything?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no allergies. Gareth's allergic to everything, not me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "That's true, I am. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything in your past health?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Depression, years ago, which is why the sertraline. And irritable bowel syndrome."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Ever had surgery?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just my tonsils, when I was eight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does anxiety run in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother has always been a worrier, she was treated for anxiety."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What's your job?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm an accountant. Quarter end is hellish, which doesn't help."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Coffee?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four cups a day. I know."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your pulse and blood pressure. Pulse 88, blood pressure 124 over 80, temperature 36.6, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 16, and weight 62 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the pulse high? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A bit quick but you're nervous, which is fair. I'm going to listen to your heart.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Shall I wait outside? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Stay, it's fine if Mia's happy. Heart sounds are normal, regular rhythm."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I can see slightly dilated pupils, which fits with a racing heart. Any trouble with your breathing between attacks?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing. I'm fine between attacks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Headaches or vision changes, anything neurological?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing. No headaches, my vision's normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Here's my thinking. This looks like panic attacks, and given the coffee and the racing heart, I can't rule out an overactive thyroid."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it my thyroid? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Possibly not, but I'd like to arrange a thyroid blood test, a blood count, and an ECG today to be sure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "And the monitor thing, the one for 24 hours? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good thought. I'd like to arrange a 24-hour heart monitor as well."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "How long does that take? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You wear it for a day, you carry on as normal. Also try cutting the coffee down gradually."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "To what? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Two cups to start. And keep the propranolol for the train for now. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the attacks haven't eased in four weeks, come back and we'll talk about talking therapy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "We'll make an appointment. ~"
  }
 ],
